bject share a visible geometric family: rectangle / L-shape / irregular.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/aa4ec2a5/25/code.py:37:#      a 2-hole object with two L-shaped holes used to become one fixed teal ring with magenta\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/aa4ec2a5/25/code.py:38:#      holes. In this combo it becomes the body color assigned to (2 holes, L-shape), while one\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/aa4ec2a5/25/code.py:286:      object's hole family as rectangle / L-shape / irregular, and recolor the whole object by\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D4/3/code.py:28:#     - A full-edge maroon line still marks the movement direction, with an aligned maroon destination line.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3a25b0d8/8/code.py:45:#    - legend rows say red->blue, green->maroon, yellow->orange, teal->pink.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3a25b0d8/8/code.py:48:#    - Combo output becomes [blue, maroon, orange, pink].\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3a25b0d8/13/code.py:25:#        legend bottom row         = [maroon, blue, yellow]\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3a25b0d8/13/code.py:26:#        decoded map               = {yellow->maroon, red->blue, green->yellow}\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3a25b0d8/13/code.py:28:#        fused-variant output      = [blue, yellow, blue, maroon]\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6ffbe589/7/code.py:79:#       clean L-shaped region where cues can sit without overlap.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D15/2/code.py:67:#   black frames, grey/orange interior, and maroon markers.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D13/0/code.py:20:#    black-bordered rectangles, grey/orange interiors, one adjacent maroon head line,\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D13/0/code.py:21:#    and one aligned maroon destination line on the movement axis.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3a25b0d8/22/code.py:27:      H1 = 2x3 re